## Task 3 – Find Hidden Pages

### Objective

Use the **Dirb** tool to discover hidden directories on the FakeBank website.

### Command Used

```bash
dirb http://fakebank.thm
```

### Description

Dirb is a directory brute-forcing tool used to discover hidden files and directories on a web server.

The scan reveals two directories:

* [http://fakebank.thm/images](http://fakebank.thm/images)
* [http://fakebank.thm/bank-transfer](http://fakebank.thm/bank-transfer)

### Answer

**Question:** Dirb found one URL, [http://fakebank.thm/images](http://fakebank.thm/images). What is the other hidden URL?

**Answer:** [http://fakebank.thm/bank-transfer](http://fakebank.thm/bank-transfer)

